    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31165" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non-dum</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adv., not yet</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nondum sex menses,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Pers. 1, 3, 57</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nondum centum et decem anni sunt, cum, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Off. 2, 21, 75</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nondum Voconiā lege latā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rep. 3, 10, 17</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Div. 2, 6, 16</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nondum Ilium et arces Pergameae steterant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 3, 109 al.</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si nondum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Sest. 7, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
